  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Communities and Return Contribution to EU-Community Stabilisation Programme Phase V (EU-CSP V)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the EU- Community Stabilization Programme V (EU - CSP V) Phase V with MCR funds is to facilitate the creation of an inclusive multi-ethnic society in Kosovo[1] through working to achieve socio-economic stability, community development initiatives, and viable income and employment creation with full access for all communities, ensuring their sustainable (re)integration, promotion of community stability and cohesion. The specific objective of the programme is to create income-generating opportunities for non-majority communities in key economic sectors in Kosovo, thereby enhancing their (re)integration prospects.&#x200b;[1] References to Kosovo shall be understood for IOM to be in the context of United Nations Security Council resolution 1244 (1999)</narrative>
  </description>
